[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730209854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104118#issuecomment-2730209854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104118","id":2730209854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iu7I-","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T16:47:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T16:47:45Z","body":"> Any idea how to debug where the issue comes from. Same setup works with godot 4.3 and 4.4 with android-export. Despite the error to run it with `--verbose` - it was already launched with verbose.\n\nThe error message might be a bit confusing as it's not changed when running on `--verbose`, but you already have the details about the leak in your logs. It's those:\n```\nLeaked instance: GDScript:9223374249803202773 - Resource path: res://Scenes/feed_scene/calc.gd\nLeaked instance: GDScript:9223374251111825623 - Resource path: res://Scenes/feed_scene/mygen.gd\n```\nAnd ones before it in your trimmed output. So I'd suggest checking what you're doing with those scripts which might trip things up. Do you have EditorExportPlugin scripts that impact the export process and might instantiate and leak those scripts?\n\n> Same setup works with godot 4.3 and 4.4 with android-export. \n\nI flagged this issue as regression because of this comment but it's a bit confusing. The issue is reported for 4.4.1-rc1 with the iOS export, and you say the *Android* export works in 4.3 and 4.4.\n\nDoes the iOS export work in 4.3 and 4.4 or do you have the same issue? Does the Android export have this issue in 4.4.1-rc1?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730209854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730879405","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104118#issuecomment-2730879405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104118","id":2730879405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ixemt","user":{"login":"LMSSonos","id":19758451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzU4NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19758451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos","html_url":"https://github.com/LMSSonos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T20:46:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T20:46:36Z","body":"Thanks for your feedback. I will try to clean out the 2 scripts to see if I can make it work.\n\n> Does the iOS export work in 4.3 and 4.4 or do you have the same issue? Does the Android export have this issue in 4.4.1-rc1?\n\nSo it's a bit more complicated ;-)\n\nWorks for Android on 4.3, 4.4, and 4.4.1-rc1\nWorks for iOS on 4.3, 4.4, 4.4.1-rc1 running on Mac-OS \nWorks for iOS on 4.3 running within github action with `macos:latest`\nFails on iOS on 4.4 and 4.4.1-rc1 running on github action `macos:latest`\n\nNow one more thing. I have another project with same settings in the github action and that works with 4.4 on `macos:latest` - so maybe it's something in the code, but the strange thing is that 4.3 it worked, issue appeard only with 4.4 - that's the main reason I reported it.\n\nI need some time to test it as it is tedious to test with the GH Actions why it fails and when not, once done (next few days) I will come back with an update if I could localize the issue in the code so that I can maybe create a public repro where the issue is reproducable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730879405/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730903343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104118#issuecomment-2730903343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104118","id":2730903343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ixkcv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T20:54:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T20:54:41Z","body":"Thanks for the details.\n\nNote that the \"Resources still in use at exit\" error shouldn't be a blocking one I think, it's just a warning that some stuff isn't properly cleaned up, but it shouldn't be an export failure. The process should still return `EXIT_SUCCESS` (`0`).\n\nAre you experiencing that your macOS exports actually fail the job on CI? If so the problem might be something else than this part of the log.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730903343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887004988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104118#issuecomment-2887004988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104118","id":2887004988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sFDM8","user":{"login":"LMSSonos","id":19758451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzU4NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19758451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos","html_url":"https://github.com/LMSSonos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMSSonos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T15:10:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T15:10:53Z","body":"@akien-mga sorry, this took longer than expected. So two things to mention\n\n1) You are right, the Resource still in use at exit is reported, the process exists with 0 (EXIT_SUCCESS)\n2) The issue with the `N13RendererDummy15MaterialStorage11DummyShaderE` occured only since godot 4.4 and only on iOS export. \n\nThe reason it occured: I have a ShaderMaterial\n```\n[gd_resource type=\"ShaderMaterial\" load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://bxekajo3kbpqn\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Shader\" path=\"res://my_shader.gdshader\" id=\"1_gfspk\"]\n[resource]\nresource_local_to_scene = true\nshader = ExtResource(\"1_gfspk\")\nshader_parameter/apply_shading = true\n``` \n\nThen in  script I preloaded the shader with `@onready var shader_material: ShaderMaterial = preload(\"res://my_shader.tres\") as ShaderMaterial` - this still worked. Once I added the preload to a additional file, I got the `N13RendererDummy15MaterialStorage11DummyShaderE` error. \n\nSo my solution is now not to preload the shader but to directly load it like this when used\n\n```\nxyz.material = load(\"res://my_shader.gdshader\").duplicate(true)\n```\n\ninstead of\n\n```\nxyz.material = shader_material.duplicate(true)\n```\n\nthis solved my issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887004988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2887013177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104118#issuecomment-2887013177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104118","id":2887013177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sFFM5","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T15:13:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T15:13:39Z","body":"Thanks for the update. That still sounds like a bug worth looking into, I don't see a priori why the code you used before would leak / be invalid. So it might be an engine bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/288701